new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5408fc2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/6324.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed the paths reported in tracebacks being shown relative to the directory
+that is current when the report is generated, which produced confusing paths
+such as ``../test_foo.py`` when a fixture changed the working directory. The
+paths are now always relative to the directory ``pytest`` was invoked from.
